{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>עוטה</b> — He stated that what is seen of His garment is light, and He wears it like a garment, in the manner of כבגד יעטה. And this light is the one mentioned in the account of Genesis, created on the first day." "<b>נוטה כיריעה</b> — on the second day, in the manner of: וימתחם כאהל לשבת (Isaiah 40:22)."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 104, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:38:06.275411447Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}